  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression = (5.32 times 5.32 - 3.64 times 3.64)/(1.68)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² − b² = (a + b)(a − b)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nLet a = 5.32 and b = 3.64\n\n⇒ (a² - b²)/(1.68)\n\n⇒ ((5.32 + 3.64)(5.32 - 3.64))/(1.68)\n\n⇒ 5.32 − 3.64 = 1.68\n\n⇒ (8.96 times 1.68)/(1.68)\n\n⇒ 8.96\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**",
